| Files changed | {{ total_files }} |
| Lines added | +{{ total_additions }} |
| Lines removed | -{{ total_deletions }} |
| Development period | {{ statistics.commits_timespan }} day(s) |
| Linked references | {{ statistics.links | length }} |

