### Upgrade Notes

Before upgrading:

1. Read the breaking changes and migration instructions above.
2. Review the release comparison for the full diff.
3. Back up any important custom configuration.
4. Pull the latest changes and re-run the setup steps.

**Get the latest release:**
[GitHub Releases](https://github.com/Armoghans-Organization/Omarchy-Tweaker/releases)

**Release notes:**
[Release Notes](https://armoghans-organization.github.io/Omarchy-Tweaker/release-notes.html)

**Report a problem:**
[GitHub Issues](https://github.com/Armoghans-Organization/Omarchy-Tweaker/issues)



